(footprint "ControllerJoint_EdgeBoard"
	(version 20241229)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "9.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Controller joint, edge-board side (SPEC V6 3.2/3.5, decision 0009). 10 SMD pads on the edge board's inward face (F.Cu), 2.54 mm pitch, 1.3 x 3.5 mm. The controller board lies flat at the rear of the panel and meets these pads at 90 deg with its own ControllerJoint_ControllerEdge pads; it is drag-soldered by hand. Pad n meets pad n: viewed from each board's F.Cu side with the joint edge (here the WALL edge) at the bottom, pad 1 is leftmost on both boards. Order 1..10: +24V GND +5V_LED LED_RETURN LED_DATA_OUT SPARE CANH CANL SENSE DRIVE. Pads are pasted so reflow pre-tins them. Placeholder geometry: the PCB session sets the row height above the wall edge from the back-plate design (see Dwgs.User lines).")
	(tags "controller joint right angle board-to-board drag solder")
